title: Add try_state hook to pallet-salary
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: "Adds a `try_state` hook to `pallet-salary` asserting its storage invariants\
    \ (`Status` set whenever a `Claimant` exists, `total_unregistered_paid` never\
    \ exceeding the cycle `budget`, and no claimant's `last_active` ahead of the current\
    \ `cycle_index`), closing part of #239 which never tracked this pallet.\r\n"
crates:
- name: pallet-salary
  bump: minor
